## [ENT-001] | 2026-11-16 23:18 UTC | Zero | claim | ref: game/routes/templates-mining.md | see: orders.log ENT-019
Claims: carry-null-matter-synchrony-nexus (1 ship), drain-methane-experiment (1), drain-ice-nexus and drain-ice-node-alpha (2 each), carry-ice-node-alpha-nexus, carry-ice-synchrony-nexus, carry-ice-experiment-nexus (3, 2, 3); the water-ice mine routes that sell at Central Nexus only on an order of 300 units at its best price: mine-cryogenic-reserve, mine-achernar-frost-ring-nexus, mine-ruchbah-ice-belt-nexus, mine-wolf-1061-frozen-drift-nexus (1, 2, 1, 1); gather-acubens-belt-carbon (1); gather-ironhollow-fading-signal (2); and up to 58 places together on the shared iron routes gather-gsc-0027-prism-scatter and gather-hamal-crystal-bloom.
